UnitPoolOracle::ObserveSingle
├── when secondsAgo is zero
│   └── it should return the current cumulative prices
└── when secondsAgo is positive
    ├── when the target lands on the at or after observation
    │   └── it should return the at or after cumulatives
    └── when the target falls between the before and after observations
        └── it should return the interpolation
